        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "https://prez.dev/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Statistical Areas Level 4 (SA4s) are designed for the output of a variety of regional data, and represent labour markets and the functional area of Australian capital cities. Most SA4s have a population of over 100,000 people.",
